  },
  "execution_requirements": [
    "Before real inference, confirm actual GPU and toolchain, same native provider settings for all arms, trusted source hashes, cancel/cleanup and per-trial deadlines. Any real-model trial consumes one of the 45 slots.",
    "Fresh independent conversation and workspace per run. GPU performance measurement is serial. No other-arm source or final-test results are exposed.",
    "Use per-trial CUDA_CACHE_PATH, TRITON_CACHE_DIR, TORCHINDUCTOR_CACHE_DIR, TORCH_EXTENSIONS_DIR and TMPDIR; use an identical prespecified baseline warmup policy.",
    "No standalone CPU dev instance. The local audit controller may drive the existing identical GPU tool; transport costs are recorded and included.",
    "Do not start a trial without enough remaining GPU budget for its full wall limit and cleanup."
  ],
